[2026-02-18 09:10] LESSON: Must ALWAYS use cursor tracking system, never raw commands
  - calibrate_to_corner() → known position at (0,0)
  - CursorTracker with 3-tier recovery (micro/macro shake, Lissajous)
  - verified_click() probes position before clicking
  - ESP32Mouse.move_to() relies on estimated_x/y — must calibrate first
  - Never send raw MOUSE:x,y without tracking
